<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon Late</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon Late</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Late la, Solomon a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kam tawpnate in hontawp lechin aw! na itna uain sang in a hoihzaw ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kinuhte’n gimlim hoihtak a nei a, na min kinuh butkhiak bang ahi a, huaiziak in nungak siangthoute’n nang a hon it uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Honkai in, nang k’on delh ding: kumpipa’n a dantante sung ah a honpita a, nang ah ka kipak un nuam ka sa ding uh, uain sang in na itna ka genkhe mun za ding ua: A dikte’n nang a hon it uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka vom a, himahleh ka mel a hoih hi, Aw nou Jerusalem tanute, Kedar puaninte bang, Solomon puankhaite bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka vom ziak in hon en ken, ni’n a honhai ziak in. Ka nu tapate ka tung ah a thangpai ua, grephuante kem in a honbawl ua; himahleh keimah grephuan leng ka kem kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Honhilh ve, aw nang ka kha in a it, na ganhon vakna mun, sunlai a na khawlsakna mun: bangding a na kithuahpihte lak a ganhon kiang a maituam bang a kei om ding ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na theih kei leh, Aw nang numeite lak a kilawmpen, ganhonte khapte zui in kuan khia inla, belamchingte puanin kiang ah na kelnoute vak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw ka it, Pharo kangtalaite lak a sakol toh k’on teh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na biang samphekte toh a kilawm a, na ngawng suangmantam khite toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dangkaeng samphekte dangka siatte toh k’on bawlsak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa a dohkan a a tutlai in, ka spiknardi gimlim in a namtuina a sawlkhia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou kei ading in murra gimlim bang ahi a, ka nawite kikal a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou kei ading in Engedi grephuante a henna pak bawk bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, na kilawm, ka it; ngai in, na kilawm; na mitte vahui bang ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai in, na kilawm ka ngaihnou, ahi, a nuam: i tutna nem leng a hing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sidar singte i inkamte ahi a, i insunte meilah singte ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saron pak ka hi, phaizang lili pak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ling lak a lili pak bang in, huchibang in tanute lak ah ka it a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamlak singte lak a apple kung bang in, huchibang in tapate lak ah ka ngaihnou a om hi. Nakpi a kipahna toh a lim nuai ah ka tu a, a gah ka chep in a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ankuangluina inn ah a honpi a, ka tung a kizak puanlap a itna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grep phoukeu in honkhou unla, apple theiin honnem un: zawlngai in ka chi a na ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khut veilam ka lu nuai ah a om a, a khut taklam in a honkawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zuktal leh gam a zukpite k’on ngen hi, Aw Jerusalem tanute, ka it hihbuai kei unla, phawng kei un, a lungkim matan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou aw! ngai un, a hong hi, mualte tung ah a tawm a, tang tungte ah a diang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou zaw zuktal hiam sakhi tuailai bang ahi: Ngai in, ka kulhbang nunglam uah ading a, tohlette ah a en a, a nannate ah amah a kimu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou in thu a gen a, ka kiang ah Pasal thou in, ka it, ka kilawmnou, hongpai meng in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, phalbi lah a beita ngal a, vuah a theuta a, a paimangta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitung ah pakte hong kilang a; vasate lasak hun a hongtung a, i gam uah vakhu aw a kizata hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theipi kung in gahhingte a minsak a, grepguite a paklun uhi, a gimlimte uh a suaksak uhi. Thouve, ka it, ka kilawmnou hongpai meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mun sang a suangpi heng a om, vakhu bang na hi, na mel hon musak inla, na aw hon zasak in, na aw a khum a, na mel a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sehalte, grephuan hihsia, sehal neute honmat sak ve; ka grephuan uh a paklun ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou kei a ahi, kei amah a ka hi: lili pak lak ah a gan a ching a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni a hongnem a, limliapte a man matan, ka ngaihnou, kihei inla, Bether mualtung a zuktal hiam sakhi tuailai bang in om in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zan a ka lupna tung a ka ihmut in, ka mang in ka it ka mu hi: Amah ka zong zong a, himahleh amah ka mu kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thou dia, khopi kim ah ka pai dia, kongzing leh lampi ah, amah ka kha in a it ka zong ding, ka chi a ka zong hi, himahleh amah ka mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khopi a vialpai vengmite’n a honmu ua: a kiang uah, Amah ka kha in a it na mu uhia? ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute ka paisan sawtlou chik ahi, huan amah ka kha in a it ka mu hi: ka paisak kei, ka nu inn sung, honpai nu dantan sung a amah ka pilut masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuktal leh gam a zukpite in k’on ngen hi, Aw Jerusalem tanute aw, ka it hihbuai kei unla, phawng kei un, a lungkim matan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdai a kipan a meikhu kitung bang a hongpai murra leh begaw kinuh a, sumsinmi nuhngou vui kinuh hiai kua ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, Solomon lupna ahi; a kim ah mi hat sawmguk, Israel mi hatte a kipan a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Namsau a tawichiat ua, kidouna a kivate ahi uhi: Michih in a pheipi tung ah namsau a tawichiat ua, zan a launa ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Lebanon sing in kangtalai a kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai a khuamte dangka in a bawl a, a nuai dangkaeng, a tutphah a sandup, a laizang, Jerusalem tanute a kipan a itna in phah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw nou Zion tanute, pawtkhia unla, kumpipa Solomon en un, a zineih ni leh a lungtang kipahna ni a, a nun amah lallukhu a khuksak toh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai in, na kilawm hi, ka it; ngai in, na kilawm hi; na maituamna liah ah na mitte vahui bang ahi ua: na sam kelhon bang ahi, Gilead mualpang a kualte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hate mulmet thak belamnu hon bang ahi ua, sil khitphet a hongpai toute; huai ah amaute chiat in phik a nei ua, a lak ua kuamah a ching a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mukte khau san-au a bang ua, na kam a kilawm a: na mit laivomte theibuhfai them bang ahi na maituamna liah ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng David galvan koihna insang a lam bang ahi, lumbem neute sang khat kikhaina mun, mi hat lum in a kivan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nawite zuktal nou nih phikte a bang ua, lili pak lak a tate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni a nem a limliap a man mateng murra mual ah leh, begaw tang ah ka hoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kilawm hi, ka it; nang ah thil nin bangmah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon a kipan honzui in, Ka mou, Lebanon apan kei toh: Amana vum a kipan dak in, Shenir leh Hermon vum a kipan, humpinelkaite kua a kipan, gialbemte mual a kipan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lungtang na tuahmangta, ka sanggamnu, ka mou; na mitte lak a khat in ka lungtang na tuahmangta hi, na ngawng a khainiang khat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na itna kilawm natel e, ka sanggamnu, ka mou! Na itna uain sang in nakpi’n a hoihzaw! Na kinuh gim, gimlim chiteng sang in a hoihzaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na mukte, Aw ka mou, khuaikhak bang in a takkhia a: na lei nuai ah khuaizu leh nawitui a om; na puansilh gim Lebanon gim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan umsuak ka sanggamnu, ka mou; tuinak kihu, tui kivuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na huansung theibuhfai, gah manphate toh ahi; spiknardi singsuan toh henna pak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Spiknardi leh pak gimlim, kepbuk leh singnamtui begaw sing tengteng; murra leh aloe, gimlim pipen teng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan a tuikhuk na hi a, tuihing lui, Lebanon a kipan a lui luangte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khanglou in, Aw mallam huih; huan hong in, nang simlam; ka huan tung ah hongnung in, Na gimnamtuite a luankhiak theihna ding in. Ka ngaihnou a huansung ah hongpai henla, a theigah manphate ne hen aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka huan sung ah ka hongpai hi, ka sanggamnu, ka mou: ka murra ka gimnamtui toh ka lakhawmta: ka khuaikhak ka khuaizu toh ka neta a; ka uain ka nawitui toh ka dawnta. Numeite Aw, lawmte, Ne un; dawn un, ahi, tampi dawn un, Aw ka ngaihnou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ihmu a, himahleh ka lungtang a hak: a kiu ka ngaihnou aw ahi, Honhon in, ka sanggamnu, ka it, ka vahui, ka nin banglou: ka lutang daitui in a dim a, ka samtum lah zan a tuitakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka puanak tung ka suahta a: bangchi’n ka silh nawn dia? Ka khepekte ka silta a; bangchi’n ka hihnin dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou in kongkhak awng ah a khut a hon golhlut a, amah ziak in ka lungtang hihlin in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou hon ding in ka thou ta a; Ka khutte murra in a tak a, ka khutzungte murra tui in, kalhna hekna tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou ka honta a; himahleh ka ngaihnou a na kiknawn a a na omta kei hi. Thu a genlai in ka kha in a hon zuausan a: amah ka zong a, himahleh hon dawng kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khopi a vialvak vengmite’n a honmu ua, a honkhen ua, a hon liamsak uh; kulhbang ngakte’n ka puanak a honlak mangsak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />K’on ngen ahi, Aw Jerusalem tanute, Ka ngaihnou na muh uleh, zawlngai in ka chi a na chih, amah na hilh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ngaihnou, ngaihnou dang sang a a tuansemna bang ahia? Aw nang numeite lak a kilawmpen? Na ngaihnou, ngaihnou dang sang a a tuansemna bang ahia, huchibang n’on nget?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou zaw a san hiuhiau a, sang sawm lak a pipen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lutang dangkaeng hoihpen a bang a, a samtumte a lian a, va-ak bang in a vom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mitte luita tui kiang a vahui bang ahi a; nawitui a sil, kituaktak a bulh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biangte gimnamtui omna bang ahi a, loupa gimlim bang: a mukte lili pak bang ahia, murra tui takkhesak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khutte dangkaeng zungbuh beril suangmantam siatna bang ahi: a pumpi saiha a bawl sapphir suangmantam a luan bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khete suangpak khuam, dangkaeng hoihte kuak a kitung bang ahi: A kilatdan Lebanon bang, sidar bang a thupi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kam a khum penpen a: ahi, a ngaihhuai tuntun hi. Hiai ka ngaihnou ahi a, hiai ka lawm ahi. Aw Jerusalem tanute.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na ngaihnou koilam a pai ahia, Aw nang numeite lak a kilawm penpen? Amah na ngaihnou koilam a kiheita ahia, amah k’on zon pih theihna ding un?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou a huan ah a hohsuk a, gimnamtui mun ah, huansung a vak in, lili pak lakhawm ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou a ka hi a, ka ngaihnou kei a ahi: lili lak ah a gan a vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kilawm hi, Aw ka it, Tirzah bang a kilawm, Jerusalem bang a deihhuai, na lauhuaina sepaih pawl puanlapte bang in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mitte kei kipan la kik in, amau lah a honzouta ua. Na sam Gilead pang a kual kelhon bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hate belamnu hon bang ahi ua, sil khitphet a hongpaitoute; huai ah amaute chiat in phik a nei ua, a lak uah kuamah a ching a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mit laivomte theibuhfai them na maituamna liah a om bang ahi .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpinu sawmguk a om ua, mei sawmgiat, huan nungak siangthou simsenglouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka vahui, ka ninbanglou, khat kia ahi; a nu lak a amah kia ahi; amah suang lak a a hoihpen ahi. Tanute’n amah a mu ua, nuamsa a chi uhi, ahi, kumpinute leh a meite’n amah a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingsang bang a dakkhia amah kua ahia? khapi bang a kilawm, ni bang a siang, sepaihhon puanlap bang a lauhuai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Makhatang huan ah ka paisuak a, guam a singsuan hingte en ding in, grep a pakmum hiam chih leh theibuhfai a pakpalhta hiam chih en ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihkeileh ka theihkhiak ma in ka kha in ka lunglutna ka mipite kangtalai lak ah a hon koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hongkik in, hongkik in, Aw Shulammi; k’on et theihna ding un hongkik in, khongkik in, Bangdia Mahanaim mite lamen bang a Shulam mi en ding na hi ua?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khedap tungneilou ah na khepekte kilawm hina mahmah e, Aw kumpi tanu: na phei guhtuah suangmantam bang ahi ua, nasem mi pil khut nasep bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lai nou bem bang ahi, huai ah uain hel a kitasam ngeikei a: na gilpi huitbuh hum lili pak siat dim a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nawi zuktal nou nih phik a bang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng saiha insang a bang; na mitte Barthrabbim kongpi a, Heshbon a om tuilite a bang uh; na nak Lebanon a insang a bang a Damaska lam muhsukna om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na tung a na lutang karmel a bang a, na lu a sam sandup a bang; huai sampha lak ah kumpipa sal a mat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw it, kipahna ding in nak kilawm in nak nop hina mahmah chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sandan tumsing bang ahi a, na nawite grep gahbomte bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tumsing ah ka kaltou ding a, huai a hiangte ka len ding, ka chi a: na nawi grepgui gahbom bang hi henla, huan na nawi gim apple bang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kam uain hoihpen pen bang hi, Ka ngaihnou adia nemtak a paisuk, ihmute muk a tolh paisuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaihnou a ka hi a, a deihlam kei lam ah a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hong in, ka ngaihnou, gam ah i paikhe ding a; khoneute ah i giak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grephuan lam ah zingkhang in i thou ding a; Grepgui a pakmumta hia, a pak palh a kihongta hia i va en ding, huan theibuhfai a pak kheta hia: huai ah ka itna k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jawlzongpak in gimnamtui a suaksak a, ka kongkhak uah thei manpha chi kim, a thak leh a lui a om, nang ading in ka na kholkhawm, aw ngaihnou.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka nu nawi ne, ka unaupa bang hile chin maw! Pawlam a k’on muh leh, k’on tawp ding; Ahi, kuamah in a hon musit kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang k’on pi ding a, ka nu inn sung ah k’on lalut ding a, aman kei a honhilh ding; uain namtui k’on dawnsak ding a, ka theibuhfai tuining.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khut veilam ka lu nuai ah a om ding a, a khut taklam in a honkawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />K’on ngen hi, Aw Jerusalem tanute, Ka it, hihbuai kei unla, phawng kei un, a lungkim matan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai a kipan a hongtou hiai a ngaihnou tung a kingai kua ahia? Apple sing nuai ah ka hon phawng a: huai ah na nun nang a honvei a, huai ah nang hon piangsak amah nauvei in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lungtang a suai bang in, na ban a suai bang in kei honkoih in: itna lah sihna bang in a hat ngal a; han bang in a gilou a: huai a kuangte meikuang Toupa meikuang bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tampi in itna a phelh theikei a, tuikhangte’n a tum thei kei hi: itna ziak in min a inn a vante pe ding hita leh, nakpitak a muhsit in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sanggamnu neu ka nei ua, nawi a neikei: A tungtang kigen ni’n ka sanggamnu uh a ding in bang ka hih ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulhbang hi leh bel, amah tung ah dangka insang neu khat ka lam ding ua: kongkhak hita leh, amah sidar singpek in ka sungkhum ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulhbang ka hi a, ka nawite huai a insang bang ahi uh: huchihlai in mi muanna musa bang in a mit ah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baal Hamon ah Solomon in grephuan a nei hi; kemmite kiang ah grephuan a khelsak a; huai a a gah ading in michih in dangka sang khat ngen a hontawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grephuan, kei a ahi a, ka ma ah a om: Aw Solomon, nang, sang na nei ding a, huai a theigah kemte’n za nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang huante sung a teng, na kithuahpihte’n na aw a ngai ua, huai hon za sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kinmeng in, ka ngaihnou, gimlim mualtung a zuktal hiam sakhi tuailai hiam bang in om in.
  </para>
</usx>
